@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Active exam workspace (Views/ExamWindow, Services/Lockdown/LockdownCoordinator + ProcessGuardService +
' DeviceGuardService, Services/LiveMonitoringService: 10 s heartbeat timer + 1 s tick, ApplyProctorCommands,
' ApplyWebcamRequirement -> WebcamMonitorService; ReportViolation -> event spool -> POST
' /api/monitoring/events/batch, CaptureForViolation -> capture spool -> POST /api/monitoring/screenshot;
' MonitoringController pushes hub ViolationEvent / ScreenshotUploaded; ExamWindow.OnServerSessionStatus,
' ShowProctorWarnings, ApplyUnlockDeadline, ResyncRemaining).
' Simplified labels: guard event kinds, ack fields and endpoints are in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}

|Student|
|Desktop App|
|Server|
|Desktop App|
start
:Full-screen exam window,
start guards (unless
lockdown Off) and webcam
monitor (if required);
fork
  |Student|
  repeat
    :Answer a
    question
    (auto-saved);
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes])
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  repeat
    :Heartbeat
    every 10 s>
    :Ack<
    :Apply: timer,
    warnings,
    lockdown;
  repeat while (In\nprogress?) is ([yes])
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  repeat
    :Guard
    event<
    if (Enforce and
    app not allowed?) then ([yes])
      :Kill
      process;
    else ([no])
    endif
    :Send event
    and screen
    capture>
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes])
fork again
  |Server|
  repeat
    :Request<
    :Store it,
    ack a
    heartbeat;
    :Push to
    live monitor;
  repeat while (Session\nopen?) is ([yes])
  |Desktop App|
end fork
:Stop guards,
restore desktop;
stop
@enduml
